    "detailed_description": "<strong>Farm Wars the farmer's wrath</strong> is a survival roguelike where you protect your farm from an alien invasion by shooting them and sometimes get temporary weapons or recover your health to continue your battle against the aliens.<br><br>You start with your standard shotgun, but you can choose temporary cards that can give your weapon special powers.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[*[b]]Power-up Cards: [/b]Cards that can give temporary special powers to your shotgun.</ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Recover life Card:</strong> A card that can change the outcome of your game because it can give you all your life when you are about to die, but you need a lot of luck for it to appear.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Farm Wars the farmer's wrath</strong> is a survival roguelike where you protect your farm from an alien invasion by shooting them and sometimes get temporary weapons or recover your health to continue your battle against the aliens.<br><br>You start with your standard shotgun, but you can choose temporary cards that can give your weapon special powers.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[*[b]]Power-up Cards: [/b]Cards that can give temporary special powers to your shotgun.</ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Recover life Card:</strong> A card that can change the outcome of your game because it can give you all your life when you are about to die, but you need a lot of luck for it to appear.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "When alien beings decide to invade and conquer Earth, they don't expect such a powerful enemy: A very angry farmer, join him in the battle against dangerous and lethal aliens and win back the farm that is rightfully yours.",
